        (*parser.Part)({
          Name: (string) "",
          Type: (string) (len=9) "paragraph",
          Value: (string) (len=916) "Federer has huge popularity in the world of sport, and is considered by many to be the greatest tennis player of all time. Between 2009 and 2018, many players and analysts considered him to be the greatest player ever. He was also called the greatest athlete of his generation by some sports reporters after he won his 19th and 20th major titles. In 2005, Rod Laver described Federer as an \"unbelievable talent\", \"capable of anything\", and that \"he could be the greatest tennis player of all time\". When he finally won the French Open in 2009, former world No. 1s Björn Borg and Pete Sampras both hailed him as \"the greatest player that played the game\", though in 2021 Sampras said the greatest was now Djokovic. Federer himself has downplayed these claims, stating in 2012 that it is impossible to compare tennis players from different eras and that past champions are needed to pave the way for future champions.",
